{"schemaVersion":1,"id":31,"sections":[{"id":"113004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1020],"start":0,"count":16},{"id":"113004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11010],"start":16,"count":15},{"id":"113005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1030],"start":31,"count":11},{"id":"113005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11020],"start":42,"count":10},{"id":"113006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1040],"start":52,"count":7},{"id":"113006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11030],"start":59,"count":3}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:2","scriptId":1020,"text":"日落西山，赶在太阳完全消失之前赶到了一个中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:3","scriptId":1020,"text":"“天色也不早了，今天就在这个中继站休息吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":null,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:4","scriptId":1020,"text":"“恩，那么就在中继站周边扎营吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:5","scriptId":1020,"text":"“佐伊和莉娜去搭帐篷。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:6","scriptId":1020,"text":"“哦，这就来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:7","scriptId":1020,"text":"“没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":31,"right":81,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:8","scriptId":1020,"text":"“那我也来帮忙。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:9","scriptId":1020,"text":"我刚想起身，被佐伊一把拉住。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:10","scriptId":1020,"text":"“长官不用帮忙，应付好教官就行了。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:11","scriptId":1020,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:12","scriptId":1020,"text":"“普莉玛就准备晚餐吧，中继站那边应该会有些补给食材。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":100,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:13","scriptId":1020,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:14","scriptId":1020,"text":"大家都开始各自忙碌开了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:15","scriptId":1020,"text":"“你们的默契不错嘛，是因为一起执行了几次任务的关系？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:16","scriptId":1020,"text":"“应该是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-PROLOGUE:1020:17","scriptId":1020,"text":"（这么说起来，和奈乐小队接触的时间也挺长了呢……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:1","scriptId":11010,"text":"准备完晚餐以后，大家围坐在一起。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:2","scriptId":11010,"text":"“很久没有和学生们一起吃晚餐了，感觉挺不错啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:3","scriptId":11010,"text":"“还好吧，是索菲亚教官平日太忙了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:4","scriptId":11010,"text":"（其实大家应该是都怕和教官一起吃饭吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:5","scriptId":11010,"text":"“我和老爸一起吃饭的机会也不多，不是我有任务就是老爸要开会。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:6","scriptId":11010,"text":"“隆美尔司令也是大忙人啊，哈哈哈。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:7","scriptId":11010,"text":"（好紧张……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:8","scriptId":11010,"text":"“佐伊怎么不吃啊，没食欲吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:9","scriptId":11010,"text":"“没…没食欲？不不，我只是……只是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:10","scriptId":11010,"text":"“我想她只是有点胃痉挛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:11","scriptId":11010,"text":"“长官，真是多嘴，我只是还没开动而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:12","scriptId":11010,"text":"“哈哈，佐伊也真是容易紧张～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":87,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:13","scriptId":11010,"text":"“想当初的吊车尾佐伊，现在也已经变成一名优秀的钢舞姬。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":87,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:14","scriptId":11010,"text":"“恩，确实已经成长了不少，虽然还是有点不靠谱。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113004-EPILOGUE:11010:15","scriptId":11010,"text":"（长官真是的，就不能多夸我几句吗！？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:2","scriptId":1030,"text":"“前方路口处发现大群战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:3","scriptId":1030,"text":"“那就从侧面绕过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:4","scriptId":1030,"text":"“不行，来不及了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:5","scriptId":1030,"text":"果然前方大群战车兽已经黑压压的一片杀到。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:6","scriptId":1030,"text":"“呃，那就只能正面上了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:7","scriptId":1030,"text":"“等等，让我来吧，很久没有活动胫骨了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:8","scriptId":1030,"text":"“教官要亲自上阵吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":100,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:9","scriptId":1030,"text":"“那我从后方援护您。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":100,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:10","scriptId":1030,"text":"“我还没弱到需要你们援护的地步～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":100,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:11","scriptId":1030,"text":"“恩，你们都退下好了，对了最好退远点～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":100,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-PROLOGUE:1030:12","scriptId":1030,"text":"说完，索菲亚教官便下了吉普车，一个人朝那群战车兽走去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":100,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:1","scriptId":11020,"text":"一只又一只的战车兽倒下了----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":100,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:2","scriptId":11020,"text":"……31、32、33，数字还在直线上升。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":219,"right":100,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:3","scriptId":11020,"text":"“哇……这真是太壮观了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":88,"right":100,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:4","scriptId":11020,"text":"每次都有大量的炮弹射向教官，然而那些炮弹最后都被弹飞后在别处爆炸了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":88,"right":100,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:5","scriptId":11020,"text":"“完美的防御姿态，利用装甲板的偏移角度来弹开敌人的炮弹攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":100,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:6","scriptId":11020,"text":"“整套动作如行云流水一般，仿佛都已经预测到了对方的弹道，何等的动态视力……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":100,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:7","scriptId":11020,"text":"“虽然知道索菲亚教官很强，但是从来没见过教官的实战啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:8","scriptId":11020,"text":"“这怪物般的战斗力……果然是真·魔鬼教官啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:9","scriptId":11020,"text":"当众人还在感叹教官惊人的战斗力时，前方的战斗已经宣告完结。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113005-EPILOGUE:11020:10","scriptId":11020,"text":"硝烟散尽，索菲亚教官掸去身上的灰尘朝众人走来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:2","scriptId":1040,"text":"索菲亚教官回到了副驾驶座上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":100,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:3","scriptId":1040,"text":"“继续开车吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:4","scriptId":1040,"text":"“哦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:5","scriptId":1040,"text":"“稍微流了点汗，不过舒服多了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:6","scriptId":1040,"text":"“教官真是太厉害了，凭一己之力就干掉了那么多战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:7","scriptId":1040,"text":"“还行吧，这点程度也就热身而已啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-PROLOGUE:1040:8","scriptId":1040,"text":"（这种程度原来还只是热身啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-EPILOGUE:11030:1","scriptId":11030,"text":"“既然教官那么厉害，那么桑赫斯特的伊莎贝尔教官岂不是也很强悍？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-EPILOGUE:11030:2","scriptId":11030,"text":"“确实，不得不说傻丘的防御功夫确实一流，当然了在进攻方面就不如我了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"113006-EPILOGUE:11030:3","scriptId":11030,"text":"（哇……这个人在非正式场合就若无其事的把伊莎贝尔教官的外号往外捅啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-02.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["在日落前到达中继站休息，这次是和索菲亚教官一起……","继续向着马奇诺进发--","索菲亚教官的战斗简直不是一个次元的……"]}
